Object.assign(window.BODY=window.BODY||{},{"bf21": "<h2 id=\"第-21-法-交车相合交关利-十种交车格\">第 21 法　交车相合交关利：十种交车格</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　临机应变，或战或守，或退或和，视课体而行焉</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"交车长生-宜合本营生\">交车长生：宜合本营生</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">交车长生，大宜合本而作营生，庚寅干上亥、支上巳，甲申干上巳、支上亥，戊申伏吟，戊寅返吟。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 21 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　交车长生，即干上神为支之长生、支上神为干之长生。占得此课，大多宜合本做生意。如庚寅日第十局，干上神亥、支上神巳；甲申日第十局，干上神巳、支上神亥；戊申日第一局伏吟课；戊寅日第七局返吟课。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　庚寅日第 10 局　月将 酉 加占时 午　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">庚</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄申</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>申 → 亥 → 寅</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：交车长生 · 庚寅日第十局，干上亥为支长生、支上巳为干长生</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"交车合财-宜交关取财\">交车合财：宜交关取财</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">交车合财，惟宜交关取财，以财交涉最好。辛丑干上子、支上卯，辛巳干上申、支上卯，壬申返吟，辛卯伏吟，癸未午加癸、子加未。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 21 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　交车合财，即干上神为支之妻财、支上神为干之妻财。占得此课，宜合作求财、以财交涉诸事。如辛丑日第十一局，干上神子、支上神卯；辛巳日第三局，干上神申、支上神卯；壬申日第七局返吟；辛卯日第一局伏吟；癸未日第八局，午加癸、子加未。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　辛丑日第 11 局　月将 申 加占时 午　（元首）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">辛</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄戌</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>卯 → 巳 → 未</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：交车合财 · 辛丑日第十一局，干上子为支财、支上卯为干财</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"交车脱-各有异心\">交车脱：各有异心</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">交车脱，虽相交涉而用事，彼此各怀相脱之意。如壬午干上未、支上寅，乙亥寅乙，戊辰酉戊，丁卯戊丁，甲申巳甲，庚寅亥寅各自脱；壬辰酉壬；乙未午乙自脱。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 21 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　交车脱，即干上神脱支、支上神脱干。占得此课，主双方合作办事，但彼此都想要算计对方。壬午日第五局，干上未、支上寅；乙亥日第三局，干上寅、亥上酉；戊辰日第九局，干上酉；丁卯日第三局，干上巳；甲申日第十局，干上巳；庚寅日第十局，干上亥；壬辰日第三局，干上酉；乙未日第十一局，干上午。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　壬午日第 5 局　月将 寅 加占时 午　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">壬</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄亥</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>戌 → 午 → 寅</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：交车脱 · 壬午日第五局，干上未脱支、支上寅脱干（各怀异心）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"交车害①-互相谋害\">交车害①：互相谋害</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">交车害，彼此各相谋害，但不宜相交用事，各有庚害，辛酉伏吟，乙卯伏吟，丁丑午丁，己丑午己。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 21 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　交车害，即干支互相交害。占得此课，主互相谋害，不宜合作做事。例如辛酉日第一局伏吟课；乙卯日第一局伏吟课；丁丑日第二局，干上午；己丑日第二局，干上午。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　辛酉日第 1 局　月将 午 加占时 午　（伏吟·自信）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">辛</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄戌</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>酉 → 戌 → 未</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：交车害① · 辛酉日第一局（伏吟），干支上神互作六害</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"交车害②-互相谋害\">交车害②：互相谋害</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">（同交车害）乙卯日第一局伏吟，干支上神互作六害之另例。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 21 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　交车害另一例：乙卯日第一局伏吟课，干支上神互作六害。（原文详见交车害①）</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　乙卯日第 1 局　月将 午 加占时 午　（伏吟）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">乙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄辰</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>辰 → 卯 → 子</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：交车害② · 乙卯日第一局（伏吟），干支互害之另例</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"交车空-始美终凶\">交车空：始美终凶</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">交车空，如占事始初相交之时，极和极美，后总成画饼，靡不有初，鲜克有终也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 21 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　交车空，占事开始合作之时，极为和美，但终成画饼，没有好的结果。（课体：三传皆为空亡）</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"交车刑-各自无礼\">交车刑：各自无礼</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">交车刑，如结交朋友，正和美中必致争竞，各无礼也。丙寅、戊寅伏吟，辛未、辛丑返吟。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 21 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　交车刑，好像结交朋友时，于和美之中产生竞争的关系、无礼相对。例如丙寅日第一局、戊寅日第一局为伏吟；辛未日第七局、辛丑日第七局为返吟课。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　丙寅日第 1 局　月将 午 加占时 午　（伏吟·自任）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>巳 → 申 → 寅</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：交车刑 · 丙寅日第一局（伏吟），干上神刑支、支上神刑干</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"交车冲-先合后离\">交车冲：先合后离</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">交车冲，不论亲疏，先合而后离，夫妇、父子、兄弟、客主皆然。丁丑、癸未、甲申、庚寅俱伏吟。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 21 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　交车冲，不论双方关系的亲疏，均主先合而后离，如夫与妇、父与子、兄与弟、主与客等，都是这样。例如丁丑日第一局、癸未日第一局、甲申日第一局、庚寅日第一局，都是伏吟课。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　丁丑日第 1 局　月将 午 加占时 午　（伏吟·自信）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丁</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>丑 → 戌 → 未</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：交车冲 · 丁丑日第一局（伏吟），干上神冲支、支上神冲干（先合后离）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"交车克-笑里藏刀\">交车克：笑里藏刀</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">交车克，乃蜜里砒，笑里刀之喻也。匿怨而友其人，如相交涉，必至争讼。庚子丑庚，庚戌卯庚，辛未午辛自克。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 21 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　交车克，如同蜜里有砒、笑里藏刀，表面友善而藏有怨恨之心，合作必起争讼之事。例如庚子日第八局，干上丑；庚戌日第六局，干上卯；辛未日第五局，干上午。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　庚子日第 8 局　月将 亥 加占时 午　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">庚</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄申</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>巳 → 戌 → 卯</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：交车克 · 庚子日第八局，干上神克支、支上神克干（笑里藏刀）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"交车三交-必有奸私\">交车三交：必有奸私</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">交车三交，乃三交为三传，凡因交关用事，必有奸私，或相交涉二三事。己酉辰己，丁卯辰丁，丁酉辰丁，己卯辰己，子午日无。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 21 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　三交为三传，为交车三交。此格局三传均为四仲，占事主合作办事，其中必有奸私，或者同时交涉两三件事。例如己酉日第四局，干上辰；丁卯日第四局，干上辰；丁酉日第四局，干上辰；己卯日第四局，干上辰。子、午日无此格。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　己酉日第 4 局　月将 卯 加占时 午　（元首）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">己</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>午 → 卯 → 子</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：交车三交 · 己酉日第四局，三传午卯子皆四仲为三交（必有奸私）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"交车三合①-家合外扶\">交车三合①：家合外扶</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">交车三合，乃三合为三传，支支干交车相合，亦名交合格。凡值此者，家合仁义，外人相助而成合，惟忌空亡。乙丑子乙，三传巳丑酉；辛未午辛，三传卯亥未之类。已上谓日干与支上神作六合，地支与干上神作六合，故名交车合，凡占皆主交关交易，交加交换而成合也，惟不利占解散诸事矣。此例如六十日内除甲寅、庚申、丁未、己未、癸丑五日系八专日，干支不分，交车无合，其余五十五日每日一课。内辛未日干上午，支上卯，三传卯亥未，如占交易，后必龃龉；始见龃龉，后却和合，因发用乘丁也。又丙寅日返吟亦同。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 21 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　交车三合，即三合局作三传。支干交车相合，又叫做交合格。占课得此，主家庭和睦、有仁义之家风，有外人相助而成相合之事，此格忌见空亡。乙丑日第五局干上子、三传巳丑酉；辛未日第五局干上午、三传卯亥未等均属此例。日干与支上神作六合、地支与干上神作六合，故名交车合。占得此课，宜合作、交易、交加、交换等成合之事，只不利于占解散之事。六十甲子日内，甲寅、庚申、丁未、己未、癸丑五日为八专课、干支同位、无交车合；此外五十五日每日均有一课为交车合。辛未日第五局，干上午、支上卯、三传卯亥未，占交易得此课后必有龃龉、后却和合（因发用乘丁）。另丙寅日第七局返吟亦同此例。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　乙丑日第 5 局　月将 寅 加占时 午　（元首）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">乙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄辰</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>巳 → 丑 → 酉</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：交车三合① · 乙丑日第五局，三传巳丑酉三合金局（家合外扶）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"交车三合②-家合外扶\">交车三合②：家合外扶</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">（同交车三合）丙寅日第七局返吟课，干支交六合、亦名交合格之另例。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 21 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　交车三合另一例：丙寅日第七局返吟课，干上亥合支寅、支上申合干（丙寄巳），干支交六合。（原文详见交车三合①）</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　丙寅日第 7 局　月将 子 加占时 午　（返吟·无依）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>寅 → 申 → 寅</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：交车三合② · 丙寅日第七局（返吟），干支交六合（交合格）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（交易）：干支上神互作六合，宜交关交易成合</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　日干与支上神作六合、地支与干上神作六合（交车合）。</p>\n<p>⭐ 宜交关交易、交换成合，不利占解散；分长生/合财/脱/害/空/刑/冲/三合等类而断。</p>\n<hr>", "bf22": "<h2 id=\"第-22-法-上下皆合两心齐-齐心协助\">第 22 法　上下皆合两心齐：齐心协助</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　下同心三军协力</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"上下两合格-两人齐心\">上下两合格：两人齐心</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">谓支干上神作六合，地盘支干亦作六合。如乙酉、丙申、戊申、辛卯、壬寅，此五日伏吟者是也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 22 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　支干上神作六合、地盘上支干也作六合，主两人齐心、诸事可成。例如乙酉日、丙申日、戊申日、辛卯日、壬寅日第一局，均为伏吟课。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　乙酉日第 1 局　月将 午 加占时 午　（伏吟）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">乙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄辰</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>辰 → 酉 → 卯</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：上下两合格 · 乙酉日第一局（伏吟），上神六合、地盘干支亦六合（两人齐心）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"干支相会格①-吉凶皆成\">干支相会格①：吉凶皆成</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">干支相会格，如乙酉日酉加乙，或辰加酉；丙申日申加丙，或巳加申；戊申日申加戊，或巳加申；辛卯日卯加辛，或戌加卯；壬寅日寅加亥，或亥加寅，缘上下作六合也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 22 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　支来加干或干来加支，为干支相会格，主吉凶皆成。例如乙酉日第八局酉加乙、或第六局辰加酉；丙申日第十局申加丙、或第四局巳加申；戊申日第十局申加戊、或第四局巳加申；辛卯日第八局卯加辛、或第六局戌加卯；壬寅日第十局寅加亥、或第六局亥加寅，均属此例。因为上下作六合。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　乙酉日第 8 局　月将 亥 加占时 午　（比用）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">乙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄辰</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>未 → 子 → 巳</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：干支相会格① · 乙酉日第八局（酉加乙），干支上下作六合（吉凶皆成）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"上下俱合格-人宅皆吉\">上下俱合格：人宅皆吉</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">上下俱合格，如日干与上神作六合，地支亦与上神作六合者。例如甲申日干上亥与甲干作六合，支上巳与地支申作六合。丁丑日干上午、支上子，己丑日同。癸未日干上子、支上午，庚寅日干上巳、支上亥。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 22 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　日干与上神作六合、地支与上神作六合，为上下俱合格，主人宅皆吉。例如甲申日第八局，干上亥与甲干作六合、支上巳与地支申作六合；丁丑日第二局，干上午、支上子；己丑日第八局也是这样；癸未日第二局，干上子、支上午；庚寅日第四局，干上巳、支上亥。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　甲申日第 8 局　月将 亥 加占时 午　（比用）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>子 → 巳 → 戌</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：上下俱合格 · 甲申日第八局（照原书图；格义取干上亥合甲、支上巳合申）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"独支干上神作六合格-上神相合\">独支干上神作六合格：上神相合</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">独支干上神作六合格，如戊辰日干上丑与支上子作六合，又戊辰日干上未与支上午作六合。辛未日干上寅，又干上申；乙亥日干上酉，又干上卯；丙子日干上卯，又干上酉；戊子日干上卯，又干上酉。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 22 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　干支上神作六合，为独支干上神作六合格，主有和合之事。例如戊辰日第五局，干上丑、支上子，丑子作六合；戊辰日第十一局，干上未、支上午，午未作六合；辛未日第九局干上寅、又第三局干上申；乙亥日第八局干上酉、又第二局干上卯；丙子日第三局干上卯、又第九局干上酉；戊子日第三局干上卯、又第九局干上酉。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　戊辰日第 5 局　月将 寅 加占时 午　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戊</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>子 → 申 → 辰</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：独支干上神作六合格 · 戊辰日第五局，干上丑与支上子作六合</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"交互六合格-主客相顺\">交互六合格：主客相顺</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">交互六合格，如干上神与支作六合，支上神与干作六合。如乙丑日干上子、支上酉，丙寅日干上亥、支上申，戊辰日干上酉，辛未日干上午，乙亥日干上寅，丙子日干上丑，戊寅日干上亥，每日皆有。内有一字空亡，反为凶咎。已上相合，凡占主客相顺，神合道合之象。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 22 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　干上神与支作六合、支上神与干作六合，为交互六合格。如乙丑日第五局，干上子、支上酉；丙寅日第七局，干上亥、支上申；戊辰日第九局，干上酉；辛未日第五局，干上午；乙亥日第三局，干上寅；丙子日第五局，干上丑；戊寅日第七局，干上亥，每日都有此例。如果课中有一字空亡，反为凶象。以上诸格皆有相合之意，占课得之，有主客相顺、神合道合之象。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　戊辰日第 9 局　月将 戌 加占时 午　（遥克·弹射）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戊</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>子 → 辰 → 申</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：交互六合格 · 戊辰日第九局，干上酉合支、支上申合干（主客相顺）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"外好里槎枒格-外和内害\">外好里槎枒格：外和内害</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">外好里槎枒格，凡占皆如其言。缘支干上神虽作六合，奈何地盘支干上神却作六害也。如壬申日干上寅与支上亥作六合，殊不知壬干与申支作六害。乙卯日干上丑与支上子作六合，其支干辰卯却作六害，况合空亡而害实在，凡事空喜而实害。辛酉日干上丑与支上子作六合，俱空，独留支干酉戌六害。又辛酉日干上未与支上午作六合，支干酉戌自作六害。乙卯日干上未与支上午作六合，卯辰支干自作六害。丙寅日干上寅与支上亥作六合，干巳与支寅却作六害。戊寅日干上寅与支上亥作六合，干巳与寅支干作六害。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 22 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　支干上神虽作六合、支干却作六害，为外好里槎枒格。占事逢此，虽表面和好，心里却互相算计。因支干上神虽作六合，但地盘上神却作六害。此类格局甚多，例如壬申日第十局，壬上寅、申上亥，干支上寅亥相合、干支相害；乙卯日第四局，干上丑与支上子作六合，支干辰卯却作六害，又是空亡，诸事空喜、实则有害；辛酉日第十局，干上丑与支上子作六合、俱空亡，支干酉戌作六害；辛酉日第四局，干上未与支上午作六合、酉戌自作六害；乙卯日第十局，干上未与支上午作六合、卯辰自作六害；丙寅日第四局，干上寅与支上亥作六合、干巳与支寅却作六害；戊寅日第四局，干上寅与支上亥作六合、干巳与寅支作六害。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　壬申日第 10 局　月将 酉 加占时 午　（遥克·弹射）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">壬</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄亥</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>巳 → 申 → 亥</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：外好里槎枒格 · 壬申日第十局，上神寅亥六合、地盘壬申却六害（外和内害）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"日辰邻近格-共谋求合\">日辰邻近格：共谋求合</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">日辰邻近格，缘干支相会，上神作六合者，凡占皆主有变换，彼我共谋求合之事也。如壬子日，子加亥与支上丑作六合，又是支加干兼支干相邻近也。戊午日干上午与支上未作六合，支是支加干兼支干相邻近，丙午日同。值此例者，客主相顺，神和道合。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 22 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　干支相邻、上神作六合，为日辰邻近格。占课得此，主事情有所变换、彼此共谋求合。例如壬子日第十二局，子加亥与支上丑作六合，支加干兼支干相邻；戊午日第十二局，干上午与支上未作六合，支加干兼支干相邻；丙午日第十二局亦同此例。若为此例，主客合乐、神和道合。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　壬子日第 12 局　月将 未 加占时 午　（知一）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">壬</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄亥</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>寅 → 卯 → 辰</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：日辰邻近格 · 壬子日第十二局，子加亥合支上丑、支干相邻（共谋求合）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"干支相会格②-合谋成事\">干支相会格②：合谋成事</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">干支相会格，缘上神相合而不相邻近者例，亦可相共谋而成合事。丙寅日寅加巳、亥加寅，丙戌日戌加巳及卯加戌，戊戌日戌加巳及卯加戌，壬辰日辰加亥及酉加辰。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 22 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　上神相合而不相邻近，为干支相会格，亦可共同谋事而成事。例如丙寅日第四局，寅加巳、亥加寅；丙戌日第八局，戌加巳、卯加戌；戊戌日第八局，戌加巳、卯加戌；壬辰日第八局，辰加亥、酉加辰。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　丙寅日第 4 局　月将 卯 加占时 午　（遥克·蒿矢）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>亥 → 申 → 巳</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：干支相会格② · 丙寅日第四局（寅加巳），上神相合而不相邻近（合谋成事）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（交易）：支干上神与地盘皆作六合，主客相顺</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　支干上神作六合，地盘支干亦作六合。</p>\n<p>⭐ 主客相顺、神合道合；内有一字空亡反为凶咎。</p>\n<hr>", "bf23": "<h2 id=\"第-23-法-彼求我事支传干-他人托我办事\">第 23 法　彼求我事支传干：他人托我办事</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　彼有事必来求于我者</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"支传干格-吉凶皆成\">支传干格：吉凶皆成</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">谓初传从支上起，末传归干上者，凡占必主他人委托我干谋事体，吉凶皆成，故占吉则吉遂，占凶则凶成，行人至，求取得。如癸酉日初传从支上巳起，末传至干上酉止，乃三传巳酉丑也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 23 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　此例为初传从支上起、末传归干上的格局。占得此课，必主他人委托我办事，吉凶皆成，占吉则吉遂、占凶则凶成，行人到来，求取可得。例如癸酉日第五局，初传从支上巳起用、末传至干上酉止，三传巳丑酉，便为此格。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　癸酉日第 5 局　月将 寅 加占时 午　（涉害·复等）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">癸</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄丑</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>巳 → 丑 → 酉</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：支传干格 · 癸酉日第五局，初传从支上巳起、末传归干上酉（他人托我办事）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（交易）：初传起于支、末归于干，他人托我谋事</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　初传从支上起、末传归于干上。</p>\n<p>⭐ 他人委托我干谋事，吉凶皆成，行人至、求取得。</p>\n<hr>", "bf24": "<h2 id=\"第-24-法-我求彼事干传支-我托他人办事\">第 24 法　我求彼事干传支：我托他人办事</h2>\n<h3 id=\"干传支格-勉强行事\">干传支格：勉强行事</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">谓初传从干上起，末传归在支上者，凡事勉强，不免俯求于人，亦为人抑勒，难自屈伸，旺相尤吉，死囚不安。又主为卑下所屈，兼礼下求人之意。只宜低心下意，不宜高上，百事不举，家宅不和，行人未来，病者难愈，死。如丁亥日自干上酉作初传起，至支上丑作末传止也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 24 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　此例为初传从干上起用、末传归在支上的格局。占得此课，诸事勉强而做，不免有求于他人，为人拘谨、不知屈伸。旺相则吉，死囚则主不安。又主为卑下所屈，有礼下求人之意，只宜低心下意、不宜高大孤傲。百事不举，家宅不和，行人不来，病者难愈而死。例如丁亥日第十一局，干上酉作初传、支上丑作末传，便属此例。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　丁亥日第 11 局　月将 申 加占时 午　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丁</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>酉 → 亥 → 丑</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：干传支格 · 丁亥日第十一局，初传从干上酉起、末传归支上丑（我托他人办事）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（交易）：初传起于干、末归于支，我俯求于人</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　初传从干上起、末传归于支上。</p>\n<p>⭐ 凡事勉强、俯求于人、为人抑勒；宜低心下意，不宜高上，百事不举。</p>\n<hr>", "bf25": "<h2 id=\"第-25-法-金日逢丁凶祸动-有凶而动\">第 25 法　金日逢丁凶祸动：有凶而动</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　海内方宁，不料盗贼蜂起</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"金日逢丁格-极速赴任\">金日逢丁格：极速赴任</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">如有官人占之，则赴任极速，不欲占人行年上神克去六丁所乘之神。常人占之，反宜制丁乘神。谓庚辛二干，三传、年命、日辰逢旬内六丁神者，必主凶动。如乘勾陈必被官词勾追；如乘月之死气，必亲族在外府郡报死亡而动往；乘贵人必贵人差往；乘元武主逃或妻有血灾，蛇雀尤的。如庚午、辛未二日，见卯是丁神，则因妻而凶动，不然取财而祸起，或先得财而后凶。庚辰、辛巳二日，见丑是丁神，则因父母之墓田而凶动，尤分旺相为田，死囚为墓。庚寅、辛卯二日，见亥是丁神，则因子息而凶动。庚子、辛丑二日，见酉是丁神，则因兄弟或己身而凶动。庚戌、辛亥二日，见未是丁神，则因父母长上而凶动。庚申、辛酉二日见巳是丁神，则因官鬼及长上而凶动。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 25 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　金日逢丁，为官者占得，主极速赴任，占者行年上神不宜克制六丁所乘之神；常人占得，反宜克制六丁乘神。庚辛二干属金，三传、年命、日辰逢旬内六丁神，必主有凶祸动。乘勾陈主官讼勾连；乘月死气主外府亲族丧报至、须前往奔丧；乘贵人主贵人差遣；乘玄武主逃亡或妻有血光之灾；乘腾蛇、朱雀必有凶祸。例如庚午、辛未日见卯是丁神，因妻凶动；庚辰、辛巳日见丑是丁神，因父母田墓凶动（旺相为田、死囚为墓）；庚寅、辛卯日见亥是丁，因子息凶动；庚子、辛丑日见酉是丁，因兄弟己身凶动；庚戌、辛亥日见未是丁，因父母尊长凶动；庚申、辛酉日见巳是丁，因官鬼尊长凶动。【丁神表】甲子旬卯、甲戌旬丑、甲申旬亥、甲午旬酉、甲辰旬未、甲寅旬巳（各旬丁火所临之支）。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　辛未日第 5 局　月将 寅 加占时 午　（知一）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">辛</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄戌</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>卯 → 亥 → 未</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：金日逢丁格 · 辛未日第五局，卯是丁神乘天后（因妻而凶动）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"火鬼蛇雀克宅格-天火焚伐\">火鬼蛇雀克宅格：天火焚伐</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">火鬼蛇雀克宅格，缘火鬼乘朱雀而克宅神，其末传又乘丁而遥克日干者，例惟庚辰日卯加辰，冬占用昼将是也。如值此课，必遭天火焚伐而怨也。余有火鬼乘蛇雀而克宅者例。春占火鬼是午，如甲申、戊申、庚申三日并午加申，用夜将乘腾蛇而克宅，宜以井泥涂灶禳之。夏占火鬼是酉，秋占火鬼是子，冬占火鬼是卯。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 25 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　朱雀、腾蛇乘火鬼克宅，因火鬼乘朱雀能克宅神，其末传乘丁而遥克日干，主遭天火焚伐。此火鬼并非庚辛日见巳午之鬼，而是一种神煞：春在午、夏在酉、秋在子、冬在卯。例如甲申日第三局昼占，午加申，火鬼午乘腾蛇克宅，宜以井泥涂灶禳之。【火鬼表】春午、夏酉、秋子、冬卯（季煞顺行四仲）。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　甲申日第 3 局　月将 辰 加占时 午　（涉害）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>午 → 辰 → 寅</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：火鬼蛇雀克宅格 · 甲申日第三局（昼占），火鬼午乘腾蛇克宅（天火焚伐）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"人宅罹祸格-人宅必咎\">人宅罹祸格：人宅必咎</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">人宅罹祸格，缘日上神克日，而辰上神乘丁又克日，主身宅皆凶，人且灾而宅必动摇，惟有官人占赴任极速，宜乎昼将。凡六庚日巳加庚，六辛日午加辛者，皆丁神临宅。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 25 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　日上神克日、辰（支）上神乘丁神又克日，为人宅罹祸格。如丁神乘腾蛇克干临宅，主人宅皆罹祸患。六庚日巳加庚、六辛日午加辛，都是丁神临宅。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　庚子日第 4 局　月将 卯 加占时 午　（知一）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">庚</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄申</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>午 → 卯 → 子</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：人宅罹祸格 · 庚子日第四局（昼占），日上巳克日、丁神临宅（人宅皆咎）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"蛇虎遁鬼格-大凶大动\">蛇虎遁鬼格：大凶大动</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">蛇虎遁鬼格，专论蛇虎二爻，谓六甲日遁旬内之庚乘白虎在六处，并辛日遁旬内之丁乘腾蛇在六处者。凡占至凶至危，至怪至动，纵空亡不能解救。如甲子日，庚午加戌，三传戌午寅，并用昼将，此乃遁旬内之庚乘白虎而遥伤日干者例。辛巳日丁丑乘蛇加巳临宅，三传午寅戌，此乃遁旬内之丁乘腾蛇而遥作日干者例。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 25 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　六甲日遁旬内之庚乘白虎在六处、六辛日遁旬内之丁乘腾蛇在六处，为蛇虎遁鬼格。占得此格，大凶大危、大怪大动，纵是空亡也不能解救。如甲子日第五局，庚午加戌，三传戌午寅，昼将发用——遁干庚（午）乘白虎，遥伤日干；辛巳日第五局，丁丑乘腾蛇加巳临宅，三传午寅戌——遁干丁乘腾蛇，遥作日干。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　甲子日第 5 局　月将 寅 加占时 午　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>戌 → 午 → 寅</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：蛇虎遁鬼格 · 甲子日第五局（昼占），遁干庚（午）乘白虎遥伤日干（大凶大动）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"凶怪格-极怪极凶\">凶怪格：极怪极凶</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">凶怪格，谓月厌、大煞、天目、墓神、丁神，皆主怪异凶灾，并临年命日辰。如乙巳日干上未，四月占；庚辰、辛巳日干上丑，十月占，此主极怪极凶。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 25 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　月厌、大煞、天目、墓神、丁神这些主怪异、凶灾的神煞，并临年命、日辰，为凶怪格。如乙巳日第十局，干上未（丁神），四月占；庚辰日第八局、辛巳日第十局，干上丑，十月占，均属此格，主极怪极凶。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　乙巳日第 10 局　月将 酉 加占时 午　（比用）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">乙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄辰</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>未 → 戌 → 丑</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：凶怪格 · 乙巳日第十局，丁神未等凶煞临日辰（极怪极凶）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"马载虎鬼格-占主凶速\">马载虎鬼格：占主凶速</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">马载虎鬼格，如甲寅日申加午为末传，昼将又乘白虎，又伏吟，又申加戌，又申加亥，并用昼将，戊午日寅加未昼将，戊辰日寅加未，又寅加酉，又寅加亥，并用夜将，白虎克干。余甲戌及戊申此二日，虽有此例，赖鬼空亡不能为害，凡占主凶速。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 25 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　丁神所乘之神为官鬼、又为驿马，且乘白虎，为马载虎鬼格，主凶速。（书评注：壬课中实不见此课——辛未、辛卯、辛巳三日见丁巳虽为日鬼驿马，但昼夜占均不乘白虎；丁日见亥鬼马相并却非驿马；以天马论则干上又非遁丁神。故此论不能成立，无正例盘。）</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"蛇虎乘丁格-人宅凶祸\">蛇虎乘丁格：人宅凶祸</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">蛇虎乘丁格，如乙亥日丑加亥，辛亥日未加亥者，乃丁作白虎而克支辰，必因家宅而有动，不然屋宇塌倒以致损人口，或染灾病而不可免。余日鬼乘丁作腾蛇尤凶尤怪。乙未日干上酉，夜乘腾蛇亦凶。外有丁神作日鬼乘白虎而克日干者，未免本身有凶动也。惟有己巳一日卯加巳，夜将乘白虎而克干者是也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 25 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　腾蛇、白虎乘丁神，为蛇虎乘丁格。克干，主本身有凶；克支，主家宅有变、屋宇塌倒、人口有灾。例如乙亥日第十一局丑加亥、辛亥日第五局未加亥，为丁作白虎而克支辰，主家宅迁移或屋宇倒塌、人口有损，或染灾病。其余日鬼乘丁作腾蛇尤主凶怪；乙未日第八局干上酉、夜乘腾蛇亦凶。另丁神作日鬼乘白虎而克日干者（如己巳日第三局卯加巳、夜将乘白虎克干），未免己身有凶动。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　乙亥日第 11 局　月将 申 加占时 午　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">乙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄辰</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>申 → 戌 → 子</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：蛇虎乘丁格 · 乙亥日第十一局，丁神丑乘白虎克支（家宅凶祸）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（鬼贼）：庚辛金日逢旬内六丁神，必主凶动</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　庚辛金日，三传年命日辰逢旬内六丁神。</p>\n<p>⭐ 必主凶动；官人赴任极速，常人宜制丁乘神。分乘勾陈/死气/贵人/玄武/蛇雀而断。</p>\n<hr>", "bf26": "<h2 id=\"第-26-法-水日逢丁财动之-必主财动\">第 26 法　水日逢丁财动之：必主财动</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　掠敌人之粮必得</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"水日逢丁格-必主财动\">水日逢丁格：必主财动</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">惟畏占人行年上神，克去六丁所乘之神，则财不动。谓壬癸二日，三传、年命、日辰之六处，逢旬内之丁神者，必主财动，及远方封寄财物付本身之象。如未有妻，则有娶妻之喜，如已有妻，则主别妻之忧。如壬申、癸酉二日见卯是丁，则因子息动而有财。壬午、癸未二日见丑是丁，则因官鬼之财动。壬辰、癸巳二日见亥为丁，则因己身或兄弟党之财动，内有癸巳日见亥丁马交加，财动又速。壬寅、癸卯二日见酉是丁，则因父母或长上而财动。壬子、癸丑二日见未是丁，则因官鬼之财动，内癸丑日干上未并初传是丁，缘三传皆鬼，不可取财。壬戌、癸亥二日见巳是丁，则因妻之财动，内有癸亥巳为丁马交加，财动尤速，离妻娶妻更的。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 26 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　此例指壬、癸水日占课，三传、年命、日辰六处见旬内之丁神，必主财动，或主远方寄财物来。但若占人行年上神克六丁所乘之神，则主财不动。如未成亲，主有娶妻之喜；如已有妻，主与妻离别。例如壬申、癸酉日旬丁见卯，因子孙动而有财；壬午、癸未日旬丁见丑，因官鬼而财动；壬辰、癸巳日旬丁见亥，因己身或兄弟而财动（癸巳日丁马交加财动更速）；壬寅、癸卯日旬丁见酉，因父母尊长而财动；壬子、癸丑日旬丁见未，因官鬼而财动（癸丑日三传皆鬼故不可取财）；壬戌、癸亥日旬丁见巳，因妻妾而财动（癸亥日巳为丁马、财动更速、离妻娶妻更的）。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　壬申日第 9 局　月将 戌 加占时 午　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">壬</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄亥</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>未 → 亥 → 卯</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：水日逢丁格 · 壬申日第九局，卯是丁神（因子息动而有财）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"财乘丁马格-因妻而动\">财乘丁马格：因妻而动</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">财乘丁马格，缘财神乘丁，或为驿马者，必因出入求财或因妻动用者。如丁马交加，必因妻财而非细之动。如己丑日亥为财乘丁马，甲辰、乙巳见未，丙申、丁酉见酉，戊子日见亥，甲戌、乙亥日见丑。太常乘日之长生临日干上者，来人必占婚姻之喜，或有锡赐物帛之事。太常乘日之长生临支上者，宅中必有婚礼之喜，或宜开彩帛铺或开酒食店肆，后有长进。如甲子日夜占，亥加子作太常，为日长生，又是交车合并。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 26 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　财神乘丁神或驿马，为财乘丁马格。主因出入求财或因妻子而动；如丁马交加，则必因妻财而有大动。例如己丑日第九局，亥为财、乘丁马；甲辰、乙巳日见未，丙申、丁酉日见酉，戊子日见亥，甲戌、乙亥日见丑。又：太常乘日之长生临日干上，主来人占婚姻之喜或赐物帛之事；临支上，主宅中婚礼之喜、或宜开彩帛铺酒食店。如甲子日第二局夜占，亥加子作太常、为日长生，又是交车合，占婚尤的。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　甲子日第 2 局　月将 亥 加占时 子　（比用）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>子 → 亥 → 戌</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：财乘丁马格 · 甲子日第二局（夜占），亥乘太常作日长生、又交车合（占婚尤的）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"牛女相会格-占婚必成\">牛女相会格：占婚必成</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">牛女相会格，缘丑中有牛宿，子中有女宿，子与丑合，乘太常为用。如乙丑、己丑，子加丑；丙子、壬子，丑加子乘太常，大宜占婚姻。内壬子日是芜淫体，后必不成。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 26 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　二十八宿中牛宿分野在丑方、女宿分野在子方，古有牛郎织女之故事，故云子与丑合，再乘太常宴喜之神，必有婚姻和合之喜。例如乙丑日第二局、己丑日第二局，子加丑；丙子日第十二局、壬子日第十二局，丑加子，乘太常，大都宜占婚姻。其中壬子日第十二局又为芜淫课，主婚后离异。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　乙丑日第 2 局　月将 巳 加占时 午　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">乙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄辰</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>子 → 亥 → 戌</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：牛女相会格 · 乙丑日第二局，子加丑（子丑合）乘太常（占婚必成）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（鬼贼）：壬癸水日逢丁神，主因财而动</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　壬癸水日逢丁神（丁为水日之财）。</p>\n<p>⭐ 主因财而动。</p>\n<hr>", "bf27": "<h2 id=\"第-27-法-传财化鬼财休觅-因财致祸\">第 27 法　传财化鬼财休觅：因财致祸</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　不宜掠军粮，不可受敌贿赂</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"传财鬼临格-因财致祸\">传财鬼临格：因财致祸</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">谓三传皆作日之财，而生起干上日鬼，而伤其日干者，必因取财而致祸，及防妻与鬼交而损失。余生支上鬼者，主破家。如辛亥日干上午，三传未卯亥，皆作木局为日之财，其财且不可取。此财如在虎口，又喻如刀上蜜，识事君子见其财自祸而出，必不取之，庶得全身远害。此例虽不利取财，惟宜以己财而告贵人成其事。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 27 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　三传皆作日财、生起干上日鬼而伤日干，主因取财而致祸，及应防妻子与鬼相交而致损失；若生支上之鬼，则主家宅破败。如壬寅日第五局，壬干上未土，三传戌午寅三合火局，为日财生起干上未鬼、使其克干愈甚。此课主因财致祸，占病、占讼大凶。若占功名，戊土为催官使发用，旺财生起干上未官，反为大吉之象。（《六壬大全》辛亥日卯财逢空、辛卯日未土逢空、辛未日亥水逢空之例，三传虽合局但非空即陷、无财可取、不能为祸，其举例有误。）</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　壬寅日第 5 局　月将 寅 加占时 午　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">壬</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄亥</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>戌 → 午 → 寅</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：传财鬼临格 · 壬寅日第五局，三传戌午寅火局财生干上未鬼（因财致祸）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"传财化鬼格-纳粟求官\">传财化鬼格：纳粟求官</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">传财化鬼格，缘三传作日之财，反生起支上神而作日干者。此等祸害，必自宅中而发，惟要行年本命上神克制其鬼，庶不致深害。如乙巳未乙，三传未戌丑，支上申；乙亥丑乙，三传丑戌未，支上申；丁亥申丁，三传申酉戌，支上子，惟宜纳粟得官，或以财告贵，买恩泽而补授极妙。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 27 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　三传作日财、生支上神，支上神克日干，为传财化鬼格。此格主祸害自宅中发起，只要行年、本命上神克制其鬼，便不会有大祸害。如乙巳日第十局，未加乙，三传未戌丑，支上乘申；乙亥日第四局，丑加乙，三传丑戌未，支上乘申；丁亥日第十二局，申加丁，三传申酉戌，支上乘子，只宜纳粟得官，或以财告贵、买恩泽官职；为官者占得则吉、主官职升迁。（又四己日第九局干上亥，虽为日财但三传曲直木局、木来克己土，亦宜纳粟求官。）</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　乙巳日第 10 局　月将 酉 加占时 午　（比用）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">乙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄辰</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>未 → 戌 → 丑</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：传财化鬼格 · 乙巳日第十局，三传未戌丑皆财生支上鬼（纳粟求官）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"因财致祸格-占人畏妻\">因财致祸格：占人畏妻</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">因财致祸格，或畏妻室，如带凶将，或被妻伤者，缘财爻反克干上之神者是也。如庚辰日干上丑，初传寅木为财，乘白虎而伤干上丑土，必被妻伤其命，又被丑旬中之丁作墓而覆日，亦是命运灾衰，不然娶恶妻而不孝于父母。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 27 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　日财反克干上之神，为因财致祸格。占得此格，主占者畏妻室；如带凶将，主被妻所伤。如庚辰日第八局，庚上丑既为日墓、又为日之父母；初传寅木为日财，夜占上乘白虎、乘凶将克干上父母之神，必娶恶妇、不孝敬父母，占人畏妻，或被妻伤、或因妻致灾祸。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　庚辰日第 8 局　月将 辰 加占时 亥　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">庚</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄申</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>寅 → 未 → 子</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：因财致祸格 · 庚辰日第八局（夜占），初传寅财乘白虎克干上丑（占人畏妻）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"财遁鬼格-因财致祸\">财遁鬼格：因财致祸</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">财遁鬼格，缘日上神作财，却遁旬中干鬼，必因财致祸，为食丧身，因妻成讼。如甲戌日干上庚辰，甲辰日干上庚戌，乙丑日干上辛未，乙未日干上辛丑，丙寅日干上壬申，壬戌日干上戊午，癸酉日干上己巳，丁卯日干上癸酉，戊辰日干上甲子。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 27 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　日上神作财、遁旬中干鬼，为财遁鬼格，主因财致祸、为食丧身、因妻成讼。此例课例极多，如甲戌日第十一局干上庚辰；甲辰日第五局干上庚戌；乙丑日第十局干上辛未；乙未日第十局干上辛丑；丙寅日第十局干上壬申；壬戌日第六局干上戊午；癸酉日第九局干上己巳；丁卯日第十一局干上癸酉；戊辰日第六局干上甲子。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　甲戌日第 11 局　月将 申 加占时 午　（涉害）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>辰 → 午 → 申</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：财遁鬼格 · 甲戌日第十一局，干上辰财遁旬中庚鬼（因财致祸）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"借钱还债格-不宜求财\">借钱还债格：不宜求财</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">借钱还债格，如辛酉日干上卯、支上寅，壬子日干上巳，丙午日干上申，外有乙未日伏吟，凡干支相同者，不宜求财耳，此曰借钱还债不明也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 27 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　干支上神俱为日之财神，为借钱还债格。占得此格，不宜求财。例如辛酉日第八局，干上卯、支上寅；壬子日第七局，干上巳、支上午；丙午日第十局，干上申、支上酉；乙未日第一局伏吟课。凡干支相同者，不宜求财，借钱还债不明之故。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　辛酉日第 8 局　月将 亥 加占时 午　（涉害）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">辛</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄戌</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>未 → 子 → 巳</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：借钱还债格 · 辛酉日第八局，干上卯、支上寅俱为日财（不宜求财）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（财运）：财爻遁鬼或化鬼，求财不得反招祸</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　日上神作财，却遁旬中干鬼（财遁鬼）。</p>\n<p>⭐ 必因财致祸、为食丧身、因妻成讼，求财不得。</p>\n<hr>", "bf28": "<h2 id=\"第-28-法-传鬼化财钱险危-取财有祸\">第 28 法　传鬼化财钱险危：取财有祸</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　占后同前</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"鬼护财格①-三传俱鬼-不取其财\">鬼护财格①（三传俱鬼）：不取其财</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">谓三传俱鬼，则能去比肩，既无夺财之神，于传内有一作财现，其财安稳而无破也。谓三合课中虽作日之鬼，两课俱空，独存一字，中间为财者，乃名全鬼变为财，其财终是危险中出，纵得之亦不安稳，倘君子识事，必不取其财也。如占人命年上乘日鬼，其祸仍发，亦不为财也。如丙申、丙子、丙辰三日并干上丑土，可以敌其水局，独存申金为财，如用昼将，少畏龙蛇元皆水兽，恐为祸也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 28 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　此例有两种情况。一是三传中都是鬼，则无夺财之神，一传是财。如乙巳日第十二局，三传未申酉：未虽为干财，但申酉为日鬼，财有鬼护、不怕比劫争夺，非常安稳；但财在鬼旁、鬼克干，故取之必危。二是三传合鬼局，其中鬼与另一神逢空，独存财神落实：虽财可取，终从险出，得到也不安稳，若人有见识必不取之；若占得人命年上乘日鬼，则财破。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　乙巳日第 12 局　月将 未 加占时 午　（遥克·弹射）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">乙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄辰</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>未 → 申 → 酉</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：鬼护财格① · 乙巳日第十二局，三传未申酉、未财有申酉鬼护（财安稳、取之必危）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"鬼护财格②-合鬼局-不取其财\">鬼护财格②（合鬼局）：不取其财</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">（承鬼护财格第二种课体：三合课中虽作日之鬼，两课俱空，独存一字中间为财，乃名全鬼变为财，其财终是危险中出。）如丙申、丙子、丙辰三日并干上丑土，可以敌其水局，独存申金为财，如用昼将，少畏龙蛇元皆水兽，恐为祸也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 28 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　如丙申日巳时、丑将占，三传辰申子三合水局，为日干之鬼，但辰土旬空，独留中传申金为日财；如用昼将，稍畏龙蛇元皆水兽，怕有祸患。（书白话原文尚云&quot;子水日鬼坐空&quot;；然丙申属甲午旬、只空辰巳，三传中子水并不落空，此系书误，本盘遁干示辰空、子乘庚不空。）</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　丙申日第 5 局　月将 丑 加占时 巳　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>子 → 申 → 辰</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：鬼护财格② · 丙申日第五局（巳时丑将），三传子申辰（申子辰水局）俱鬼、辰旬空、独存申金财（危中出财、取之不安）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"取还魂债格-尽力还债\">取还魂债格：尽力还债</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">取还魂债格，缘三传全为脱气，反生干上财神者。例如己丑干上亥，三传酉丑巳皆为日之脱气，殊不知金局生起干上亥水作日之财。己巳干上亥空亡尤为之验。壬寅返吟，甲戌、甲午、甲申、甲辰、甲寅日干上戌。又如丁丑日酉加巳用，墓土将生空亡之财，亦如前说。有三传为脱气、生起支上财神者，如壬寅、壬戌二日并支上午，甲午日支上戌，亦为取还魂债。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 28 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　三传合为子孙之神、脱泄日干之气，是传有脱我之意，反生干上之财，犹如尽力还他人债，故称取还魂债格。如己丑日第九局，己丑干上亥为日财，三传酉丑巳合成金局、脱己之气而生干上财；若干上财神旬空更是如此。再如己巳日第九局，己土干上亥财旬空，三传酉丑巳生干上空财，财虽得生、但旬空不为我用，只有脱气耗损落实。壬寅日第七局返吟课、甲戌／甲午／甲申／甲辰／甲寅日第五局干上戌；又丁丑日第九局酉加巳发用、墓神土将生空亡之财，占断亦如此例。三传脱气而生支上财神者，如壬寅日第九局、壬戌日第五局支上午，甲午日第九局支上戌，也为取还魂债格。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　己丑日第 9 局　月将 戌 加占时 午　（涉害）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">己</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>酉 → 丑 → 巳</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：取还魂债格 · 己丑日第九局，三传酉丑巳金局脱气反生干上亥财（尽力还债）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"求财急取格-速取其财\">求财急取格：速取其财</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">求财急取格，如乙未日未加乙，虽曰财就人格，惟宜速去取之，如缓则财反被未来墓其乙木，却恐为祸。又如辛卯日卯加辛，虽名财就人格，亦宜速取其财，如少缓，亦被卯木克其戊土，反有害也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 28 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　求财急取格，如乙未日第十局，未加乙、乙木克未土，为财临干上、主财来就人，宜速取财；因未为乙木之墓，故取财迟缓便恐成灾祸。再如辛卯日第八局，卯加辛、亦为财来就人，宜速取其财，迟缓则因卯木克戊土、反而有害。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　乙未日第 10 局　月将 酉 加占时 午　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">乙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄辰</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>未 → 戌 → 丑</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：求财急取格 · 乙未日第十局，未加乙财临干上、未为乙墓（宜速取财）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"空财格-空财索债\">空财格：空财索债</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">空财格，如丙子日酉加巳，乃空财，如用夜将反生三传之财，亦宜索债。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 28 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　空财格，如丙子日第九局，酉加巳（丙），酉为财、空亡，故为空财。夜将贵人反生三传之财，故宜于索债。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　丙子日第 9 局　月将 寅 加占时 戌　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>酉 → 丑 → 巳</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：空财格 · 丙子日第九局（夜占），酉加巳、酉财空亡、夜将反生三传财（宜索债）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"危中取财格-不免自惊\">危中取财格：不免自惊</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">危中取财格，缘干克支辰为财，支上神为鬼者，不免自惊，危中取财。如甲辰日乃甲木克辰土为财，如辰上乘申是也。甲戌日支上申空亡，似乎无畏。乙丑、乙未二日支上酉，丙申日支上亥，丁酉日支上子，戊子日支上寅，己亥日支上卯，庚寅日支上巳，辛卯日支上午，作空亡，不可畏之。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 28 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　干克支、辰为财，支上神为鬼，为危中取财格。占得此课，不免自惊、主危中取财。如甲辰日第九局，甲木克辰土、辰为财、辰上乘申、申金克甲木，属此例。甲戌日第三局支上申空亡，取财便没有危险。乙丑日第五局、乙未日第十一局支上酉金克乙木；丙申日第十局支上亥；丁酉日第十局支上子；戊子日第十一局支上寅；己亥日第九局支上卯；庚寅日第十局支上巳；辛卯日第十局支上午，均属此格；作空亡，无甚可怕。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　甲辰日第 9 局　月将 戌 加占时 午　（遥克·蒿矢）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>申 → 子 → 辰</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：危中取财格 · 甲辰日第九局，甲克辰财、辰上乘申鬼克干（危中取财）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（财运）：三传俱鬼独存一财，财出险中难安稳</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　三传俱鬼能去比肩，独存一字为财。</p>\n<p>⭐ 其财终是危险中出，纵得亦不安稳，君子不取。</p>\n<hr>", "bf29": "<h2 id=\"第-29-法-眷属丰盈居狭宅-人旺宅狭\">第 29 法　眷属丰盈居狭宅：人旺宅狭</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　凡占兵利先举</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"人胜宅格-人旺宅狭\">人胜宅格：人旺宅狭</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">谓三传生其日干，反脱其支辰者是也。值此必人口丰隆而居宅窄狭也。如甲申日干上午，三传辰申子水局全来生日，乃应人口丰盈也，申金为支辰，反生三传之水局，乃应屋舍窄狭也。如得此课，切不可迁居宽广之屋舍，恐反生灾咎，此造化使然，不可逆天理而妄作也。其余占别事，即我盛而他衰、我胜而他负，后例准此。乙酉日干上申，三传申子辰；又干上巳，三传亥子丑。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 29 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　干为人、支为宅，三传生干而脱支，故为人旺宅狭之格局。占得此课，主人口丰隆、宅屋狭窄。例如甲申日第九局，甲上午、申上子，三传辰申子合水局、水生甲木、主人口丰盈；支辰申金生三传之水、主屋舍狭窄。占得此课，不可迁入宽广的屋舍，否则恐生灾祸——此为天命，不可自作主张。若占其他事，利己不利他。再如乙酉日第九局干上申、三传申子辰；第十二局干上巳、三传亥子丑，均为此例。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　甲申日第 9 局　月将 戌 加占时 午　（元首）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>辰 → 申 → 子</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：人胜宅格 · 甲申日第九局，三传辰申子水局生日干、支辰申金反生三传（人旺宅狭）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"人旺弃宅格-弃家逃亡\">人旺弃宅格：弃家逃亡</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">人旺弃宅格，缘三传生其日干而克其支辰者。占人虽亨旺而无正屋可居，纵为官多是寄居，或欲逃亡而弃其家尤的。如丁未日卯加未，又亥加未用，癸卯日酉加巳用，甲午日子加丑，丙戌日卯加辰用。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 29 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　三传生日干、克支辰，为人旺弃宅格。占人虽主亨旺、但无正屋可居；即使做官也只能寄居，如占逃亡则主弃家而去、尤为应验。例如丁未日第五局，卯加未，以及第九局亥加未发用；癸卯日第九局，酉加巳发用；甲午日第二局，子加丑；丙戌日第二局，卯加辰发用。均属此例。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　丁未日第 5 局　月将 卯 加占时 未　（八专）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丁</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>卯 → 亥 → 未</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：人旺弃宅格 · 丁未日第五局（卯加未），三传卯亥未生日干却克支辰（弃家逃亡·卯空乘勾陈）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"赘婿卦-无正屋可居\">赘婿卦：无正屋可居</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">赘婿卦，缘支加干而被干克者。其支上又乘脱气，或克支者，必无正屋可居。如丙申日申加丙，亥脱申；丁酉日酉加丁，亥脱酉；戊子日子加戊，未克子；己亥日亥加巳，卯脱亥。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 29 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　支加干上、被干所克，支上又乘脱气、或又克支，为赘婿卦。占得此课，必主无正屋可居。例如丙申日第十局，申加丙、亥脱申；丁酉日第十一局，酉加丁、亥脱酉；戊子日第六局，子加戊、未克子；己亥日第九局，亥加巳、卯脱亥。均属此例。（此格可参阅《图解六壬大全·吉凶占断》赘婿课一章。）</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　丙申日第 10 局　月将 申 加占时 巳　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>申 → 亥 → 寅</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：赘婿卦 · 丙申日第十局（申加丙），支上神被干克、又乘脱气（无正屋可居）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（家宅）：三传生干反脱支，人口丰隆而住宅窄狭</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　三传生其日干、反脱其支辰。</p>\n<p>⭐ 人口丰隆而住宅窄狭；切不可迁居宽广之屋，恐反生灾咎。</p>\n<hr>", "bf30": "<h2 id=\"第-30-法-屋宅宽广致人衰-屋广人稀\">第 30 法　屋宅宽广致人衰：屋广人稀</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　占兵利为主而后应，或营空虚</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"宅胜人格-屋广人稀\">宅胜人格：屋广人稀</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">谓三传窃盗日干反生支辰者是也。凡值此课，必宅不容人居止，不然人口少而居宽广之屋舍，致使人口日渐衰羸、患难俱生。惟宜弃此住场而别迁居止，庶免此患。余占事皆我衰他旺、我负他胜，后例准此。如甲辰日戌加寅，甲戌日寅加戌，又壬午日未加卯。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 30 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　此例为三传盗脱日干之气、生支辰。占得此课，必主宅不容人居住，或主人口稀少而居住在宽广的屋舍中，致使人口日渐衰羸、生出患难。只宜弃此大屋、迁居别处，才能免除此患。占他事，利己不利他。例如甲辰日第五局，戌加寅；甲戌日第九局，寅加戌；壬午日第九局，未加卯。与29法人胜宅（人旺宅狭）相对：此为宅胜人、屋广人稀。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　甲辰日第 5 局　月将 寅 加占时 午　（涉害）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>子 → 申 → 辰</strong></p>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><span class=\"src\">〔订正〕</span>原存三传 <strong>戌→午→寅</strong>，按《通解》复算应为 <strong>子→申→辰</strong>（涉害；分歧类型：<strong>涉害深浅</strong>）。 原书注：宅胜人格 · 甲辰日第五局（戌加寅），三传戌午寅盗脱日干反生支辰（屋广人稀·末传寅空）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"卖宅备患格-卖屋换钱\">卖宅备患格：卖屋换钱</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">卖宅备患格，缘三传生支克干，惟宜兑卖宅舍，以钱预备灾患之费。如癸酉日辰加丑用，己巳日卯加未，丙寅日子加丑，癸酉日伏吟。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 30 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　三传合局生支而克干，为卖宅备患格。宜于卖掉宅舍、换得钱财以备抵御灾患。例如癸酉日第十局，辰加丑发用；己巳日第五局，卯加未；丙寅日第二局，子加丑；癸酉日第一局伏吟课。均属此格。（书中类格标题行误作<q class=\"yw\">买宅备患格</q>，正文与流程图均作<q class=\"yw\">卖宅备患格</q>，此从正文。）</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　癸酉日第 10 局　月将 酉 加占时 午　（元首）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">癸</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄丑</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>辰 → 未 → 戌</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：卖宅备患格 · 癸酉日第十局（辰加丑），三传辰未戌生支克干（卖屋换钱·末传戌空）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"狮兽冲宅格-家道衰替\">狮兽冲宅格：家道衰替</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">狮兽冲宅格，缘对邻兽头吻冲其本家，或有狮子道路冲宅，以致家道衰替，如对邻空亡，不足畏也。如壬辰日申加戌作白虎、冲支上寅；辛巳日伏吟，亥作虎冲支上巳；甲午、庚午二日伏吟，子作虎冲支上午；辛丑日酉加未作虎冲支上卯。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 30 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　对邻白虎冲宅，或有狮子道路冲宅，为狮兽冲宅格，主家道衰替。若白虎空亡，便不足畏。如壬辰日第三局，申加戌、作白虎、冲支上寅；辛巳日第一局伏吟课，亥作白虎、冲支上巳；甲午日第一局、庚午日第一局伏吟课，子作白虎、冲支上午；辛丑日第十一局，酉加未作虎、冲支上卯。均属此格。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　壬辰日第 3 局　月将 申 加占时 戌　（元首）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">壬</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄亥</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>寅 → 子 → 戌</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：狮兽冲宅格 · 壬辰日第三局（夜占·申加戌），申乘白虎冲支上寅（家道衰替）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"血厌克宅格-交易忌之\">血厌克宅格：交易忌之</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">血厌克宅格，缘天后乘血支、血忌作月厌，临支克支，凡交易买卖铺店，皆宜忌此。如七月癸亥日，辰作天后加亥，乃夜占，缘七月血忌在辰、月厌亦在辰，又墓克其宅神故也。止有七月占有血忌与月厌同处，余中有天后临血支、血忌之例。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 30 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　天后乘血支、血忌作月厌、临支克支，为血厌克宅格。占得此格，忌交易、买卖店铺。例如癸亥日第八局，七月占，辰作天后加亥、夜占，七月血忌在辰、月厌也在辰，又墓克其宅神，属此格。只有七月占课，血忌与月厌才同处一处，其余则为天后临血支、血忌之例。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　癸亥日第 8 局　月将 辰 加占时 亥　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">癸</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄丑</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>午 → 亥 → 辰</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：血厌克宅格 · 癸亥日第八局（七月·夜占·辰加亥），辰乘天后为血忌月厌临支克支（忌交易买卖）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（家宅）：三传盗干反生支，宅宽人少、日渐衰羸</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　三传窃盗日干、反生支辰。</p>\n<p>⭐ 宅宽人少、日渐衰羸，患难俱生，宜弃此别迁居住。</p>\n<hr>"});